    "Choose a time a few hours before bed. New worries are parked until then. Already-parked worries keep their exit time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose a time a few hours before bed. New worries are parked until then. Already-parked worries keep their exit time."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "잠들기 몇 시간 전으로 정해 주세요. 새 걱정은 이 시간까지 주차돼요. 이미 주차된 걱정은 원래 출차 시간을 유지해요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选一个睡前几小时的时间。新的烦恼会停放到那时。已经停放的烦恼保持原来的出场时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
