    "Research describes average effects, and results differ from person to person. Worry Parking is a self-help tool, not a medical device or a treatment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Research describes average effects, and results differ from person to person. Worry Parking is a self-help tool, not a medical device or a treatment."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "연구 결과는 평균적인 경향이며, 효과는 사람마다 다를 수 있어요. 걱정 주차장은 스스로 돌보기 위한 도구이며 의료기기나 치료가 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "研究描述的是平均效果，每个人的结果不同。烦恼停车场是一款自助工具，不是医疗器械，也不是治疗手段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
