            "value" : "如果我明天演讲时脑子一片空白，大家都觉得我不够好怎么办？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you feared didn't happen. Each exit like this goes into your Exit Log, so you can see how often your worries turn out wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you feared didn't happen. Each exit like this goes into your Exit Log, so you can see how often your worries turn out wrong."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정한 일이 일어나지 않았어요. 이런 출차가 출차 기록에 쌓이면, 내 걱정이 얼마나 자주 빗나가는지 눈으로 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你担心的事没有发生。像这样的出场都会记入出场记录，让你看到自己的烦恼有多少是白担心。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's circling in your head?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What's circling in your head?"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "머릿속에 맴도는 게 뭔가요?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你脑子里在转什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When people with chronic worry tracked their worries, %lld%% of them didn't come true." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When people with chronic worry tracked their worries, %lld%% of them didn't come true."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "만성적으로 걱정하는 사람들이 자기 걱정을 기록해 보니, %lld%%는 실제로 일어나지 않았어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "长期爱担忧的人记录自己的烦恼后发现，有 %lld%% 并没有成真。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When should it come back?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
