          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worry Parking" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worry Parking"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 주차장"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼停车场"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worry Parking is a self-help tool, not a medical device or a substitute for professional care. If you're struggling, please reach out to a mental health professional or local emergency services." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worry Parking is a self-help tool, not a medical device or a substitute for professional care. If you're struggling, please reach out to a mental health professional or local emergency services."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 주차장은 셀프 케어 도구이며 의료기기나 전문 치료를 대신하지 않아요. 많이 힘들다면 정신건강 전문가나 가까운 응급 기관(정신건강 위기상담 109)에 도움을 요청하세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼停车场是一款自助工具，不是医疗器械，也不能代替专业护理。如果你正感到难受，请联系心理健康专业人士或当地紧急服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worry Parking is built on worry postponement, a stimulus-control technique used in cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT): instead of fighting a worry, you schedule it for a set time and return to it then." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worry Parking is built on worry postponement, a stimulus-control technique used in cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT): instead of fighting a worry, you schedule it for a set time and return to it then."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 주차장은 인지행동치료(CBT)에서 쓰는 자극 통제 기법인 '걱정 미루기'를 바탕으로 해요. 걱정과 싸우는 대신 정해진 시간으로 미뤄두고, 그때 다시 들여다봐요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼停车场基于“烦恼推迟”——认知行为疗法（CBT）中的一种刺激控制技术：不与烦恼硬碰硬，而是把它安排到固定时间，到时再回头处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worry Parking is built on worry postponement, a technique from cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT) that has been studied for decades." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the research behind worry postponement.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worry Parking is built on worry postponement, a technique from cognitive behavioral therapy (CBT) that has been studied for decades."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걱정 주차장은 인지행동치료(CBT)에서 수십 년간 연구된 ‘걱정 미루기’ 기법을 바탕으로 만들었어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "烦恼停车场基于“烦恼推迟”，这是认知行为疗法（CBT）中已被研究数十年的技术。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worry Parking Pro" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Worry Parking Pro"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
